;; slowshield.net: redirect-only; a Redirect Rule sends every request to https://slowshield.org.
;; Import: Cloudflare > slowshield.net > DNS > Records > Import and Export, "Proxy imported DNS records" on.
;; Both names only have to resolve to Cloudflare (192.0.2.1 is the documentation range, never reached).
;;
;; No mail is sent or received on any name in this domain, and receivers are told to reject mail that claims
;; otherwise: null MX (RFC 7505) and SPF "-all" on the apex, on www (which has its own records, so the wildcard
;; does not cover it) and on every other name (wildcard); every DKIM key revoked; DMARC reject for the domain
;; and all subdomains, with strict alignment.

slowshield.net.	1	IN	A	192.0.2.1 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
www.slowshield.net.	1	IN	A	192.0.2.1 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
slowshield.net.	1	IN	MX	0 .
www.slowshield.net.	1	IN	MX	0 .
*.slowshield.net.	1	IN	MX	0 .
slowshield.net.	1	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 -all"
www.slowshield.net.	1	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 -all"
*.slowshield.net.	1	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 -all"
*._domainkey.slowshield.net.	1	IN	TXT	"v=DKIM1; p="
_dmarc.slowshield.net.	1	IN	TXT	"v=DMARC1; p=reject; sp=reject; adkim=s; aspf=s"
